    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Developed by only one person, and it will be updated irregularly! If you have any problems, please join the QQ group 140130929 to solve them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introduction to the enhanced version of the game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Send a box to the boss, but unexpectedly get trapped in a haunted house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chased by a big-breasted female ghost and a chainsaw man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several beautiful girls are trapped and it's very dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you want to save them or choose to escape alone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different choices lead to different results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you have a romance in a horror game by being a hero to save the beauty?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ending is? You must cure either your lechery or your fear of ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Male NPC: Only save the women??? Can't you save us?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hong Kong-style funny horror film style, allowing timid players to enjoy it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A magical adventure with elements of love. Up to 5 beautiful women can develop feelings!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel back to the familiar 3D scenes of the 1990s.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 12 characters with distinct personalities appear, and you can also gain the favor of young ladies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players' actions can change the development of the plot. A total of 7 endings + one bad ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two gameplay methods: story mode without weapons and zombie mode with firearms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voiced by Bilibili netizens or streamers for free. Thousands of lines of dialogue reveal the mystery for you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a production time of up to 7 years, the story mode lasts for 7 hours and the zombie mode lasts for 3 hours. There's plenty to enjoy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Developed independently by one person through self-study (poor development team)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Known problems and solutions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If operating with the mouse, please unplug the gamepad or Bluetooth transmitter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the game crashes, increase the system's virtual memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solution for not finding SAVE:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local game file BlurredWeirdNight DataldatalSavedGame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">0K or larger than 800K is a corrupted SAVE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For example: save8.sav is 0K. Delete it, copy save7.sav and rename it to save8.sav.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Restart the game.</p>",
