><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a production time of up to 7 years, the story mode lasts for 7 hours and the zombie mode lasts for 3 hours. There's plenty to enjoy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Developed independently by one person through self-study (poor development team)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Known problems and solutions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If operating with the mouse, please unplug the gamepad or Bluetooth transmitter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the game crashes, increase the system's virtual memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solution for not finding SAVE:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local game file BlurredWeirdNight DataldatalSavedGame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">0K or larger than 800K is a corrupted SAVE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For example: save8.sav is 0K. Delete it, copy save7.sav and rename it to save8.sav.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Restart the game.</p>",
    "short_description": "I thought it was a comedy, but it turned out to be a tragedy. If there's a chance to go back in time and change something that would cause lifelong regret, would you fight with all you have? (Including story mode and zombie mode)",
